#: opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Removed in glibc 2.33.  4.2BSD, POSIX.1-2001.  Removed in POSIX.1-2008."
msgstr ""
"Fonction supprimée dans glibc 2.23. 4.2BSD, POSIX.1-2001. Supprimée dans "
"POSIX.1-2008."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"This function is obsolete.  Don't use it.  If the time in seconds suffices, "
"B<time>(2)  can be used; B<gettimeofday>(2)  gives microseconds; "
"B<clock_gettime>(2)  gives nanoseconds but is not as widely available."
msgstr ""
"Cette fonction est obsolète. Ne l'utilisez pas. Si la précision en seconde "
"vous suffit, utilisez B<time>(2). Sinon B<gettimeofday>(2) fournit des "
"microsecondes, et B<clock_gettime>(2) des nanosecondes, mais elle n'est pas "
"disponible sur tous les systèmes."

