#.  The
#.  .BR ftime ()
#.  function appeared in 4.2BSD.
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Early glibc2 is buggy and returns 0 in the I<millitm> field; glibc 2.1.1 is "
"correct again."
msgstr ""
"Les premières versions de la glibc2 étaient boguées, et renvoyaient toujours "
"0 dans le champ I<millitm>. La glibc\\ 2.1.1 est correcte."

